    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "A capture device’s [`focusPointOfInterest`](avcapturedevice/focuspointofinterest.md) and [`exposurePointOfInterest`](avcapturedevice/exposurepointofinterest.md) properties provide a [`CGPoint`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGPoint) value where `{0,0}` represents the top-left and `{1,1}` represents the bottom-right of the unrotated image.",
      "ko": "캡처 장치의 [`focusPointOfInterest`](avcapturedevice/focuspointofinterest.md) 및 [`exposurePointOfInterest`](avcapturedevice/exposurepointofinterest.md) 속성은 회전되지 않은 이미지에서 `{0,0}`이 좌상단, `{1,1}`이 우하단을 나타내는 [`CGPoint`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGPoint) 값을 제공합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e83d282315b75832f9fc0ff88305efb35a74ae8ee969ddc118f3c7688f7ca8b5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "The system takes the layer’s frame size and its [`videoGravity`](avcapturevideopreviewlayer/videogravity.md) into consideration when making the conversion.",
      "ko": "시스템은 변환 시 layer의 프레임 크기와 해당 [`videoGravity`](avcapturevideopreviewlayer/videogravity.md)를 고려합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "75834f908244054618c805ff7321499791acd873510b3b9c6833c2a85b310521",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0012:0001",
